        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLN1040SMTSAL, Delano Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Aluminum Delano Door Pull is perfect to make a statement on your front door. This sizable, 40 inch Door Handle is modern. It looks great in any of the available finish colors. The First Impressions Delano Pull is made right here in the USA. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLN02-installed.jpg?v=1704354726\" width=\"246\" height=\"244\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions Delano Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DLN1040SMTSAL Modern Delano Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 40\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .38\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLN02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262382\"><b>First Impressions DLN1040SMTSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 Sets of Pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Aluminum Delano Door Pull",
                "description": "The Aluminum Delano Door Pull is perfect to make a statement on your front door. This sizable, 40 inch Door Handle is modern. It looks great in any of the available finish colors. The First Impressions Delano Pull is made right here in the USA. \r\n",
